From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mckenna654 <mckenna654@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:33:20 +1100
Subject: fix: no Professor Oak lecture in the first rival battle with the
 picture menu

The player controller already replaced Oak's, but the opponent's controller still
started the lecture after the first hit and after a loss. It was drawn with
background palette 7, which the picture menu loads its own colours into, so it
came out as a rainbow frame on red. One rule (LT_OakBattleLectureActive) now
decides both.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CNqSDphYuD2Aqe9TExdQMP

